</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.800" end="00:00:05.900" style="s2">Before you sell his genius, [music] turn</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.200" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">the bird around. Ask him why the left</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.900" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">wing opens first.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.500" end="00:00:13.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She assisted me. [music] This is an</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.600" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">unfortunate personal dispute, not part</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.300" end="00:00:15.000" style="s2">of tonight&#39;s event.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.000" end="00:00:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then explaining your own design should</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.000" end="00:00:18.395" style="s2">be easy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:18.395" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.400" end="00:00:27.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the object unsafe or [music] is the</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.800" end="00:00:28.100" style="s2">description false? Those are different</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.300" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">problems.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.100" end="00:00:31.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I designed it. I don&#39;t claim to own this</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.800" end="00:00:33.100" style="s2">object. Check the credit before selling</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.600" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">it under his name.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.100" end="00:00:36.600" style="s2">This slot [music] is withdrawn pending</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.400" end="00:00:38.000" style="s2">verification. Both parties may submit</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.600" end="00:00:38.900" style="s2">their records.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:42.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always needed somebody [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:42.600" style="s2">else&#39;s room to make yourself important.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.100" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">Our theater has been dark for 3 years.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.470" end="00:00:51.700" style="s2">[music] That bird was built for it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">Could you inspect what remains?</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.700" end="00:00:55.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask for a designer, not a grateful woman</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.400" end="00:00:56.500" style="s2">you can pay to stay quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.300" end="00:00:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A paid inspection. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.500" end="00:00:59.600" style="s2">Your findings stay yours, including</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.200" end="00:01:00.400" style="s2">anything I dislike.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.600" end="00:01:03.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the stage where they [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.400" end="00:01:03.100" style="s2">ended my career.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.775" end="00:01:11.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.000" end="00:01:13.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eli, this is the designer. She isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.600" end="00:01:15.400" style="s2">here to replace anybody in your family.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:17.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can leave it here or help straighten</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.400" end="00:01:18.600" style="s2">the wing. You get to choose.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.500" end="00:01:19.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It used to stand up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:21.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.200" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll start with standing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.100" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">Flying can wait till you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.500" end="00:01:29.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I let you fix it, do you take the old</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.200" end="00:01:31.100" style="s2">one away?</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.800" end="00:01:34.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. A new thing doesn&#39;t have to [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:34.300" style="s2">erase the thing you loved first.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.300" end="00:01:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your inspection starts across the</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.400" end="00:01:41.000" style="s2">courtyard and it stays here with Eli.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.600" end="00:01:44.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can the new bird stay too?</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.200" end="00:01:52.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The trustees require one viable</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:53.100" style="s2">reopening proposal before considering</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.200" end="00:01:55.300" style="s2">closure. They&#39;ve allowed [music] 6</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.100" end="00:01:56.600" style="s2">weeks. I doubt you&#39;ll change the costs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.300" end="00:01:58.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me inspect the records, not just the</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.600" end="00:02:01.192" style="s2">building. This notice names me. It never</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:02.592" style="s2">included my</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.192" end="00:02:04.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An external review [music] with its own</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.592" end="00:02:05.292" style="s2">records access, not one edited by us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.092" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that in the contract. That&#39;s why I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.292" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">consider coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.792" end="00:02:12.992" style="s2">Restoration and a pilot performance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.656" end="00:02:14.392" style="s2">[music] Not permission to sell my story</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.992" end="00:02:16.292" style="s2">or attach your name to my work.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.392" end="00:02:18.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed. Creator rights stay yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.292" end="00:02:19.892" style="s2">Payment covers completed work even if</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.092" end="00:02:21.392" style="s2">the theater closes. Six weeks to submit</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.892" end="00:02:22.492" style="s2">the pilot and operating proposal. The</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.392" end="00:02:23.492" style="s2">trustees decide after [music] reviewing</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.492" end="00:02:24.892" style="s2">both, not on applause alone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.492" end="00:02:26.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Neither will your aunt&#39;s opinion</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.892" end="00:02:28.492" style="s2">of me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.592" end="00:02:29.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask Owen for archive access. This key is</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.492" end="00:02:32.892" style="s2">only for your room.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.892" end="00:02:32.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No pretending we&#39;re a family?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.992" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You can live elsewhere. Owen&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.892" end="00:02:41.492" style="s2">parents died in a road [music] accident</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.092" end="00:02:42.692" style="s2">two years ago. I&#39;m his guardian. Anita</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.492" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">shares his care.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.692" end="00:02:45.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dinner at [music] 7:00.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:47.681" style="s2">Attendance isn&#39;t a condition of your</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.692" end="00:02:49.592" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.681" end="00:02:50.892" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.592" end="00:02:52.192" style="s2">The floor level area can be surveyed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.892" end="00:02:53.192" style="s2">Nothing suspended moves until the</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.192" end="00:02:54.492" style="s2">relevant checks are complete. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.192" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the first show starts on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.492" end="00:02:57.692" style="s2">Nobody needs to risk an act to prove I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.592" end="00:02:58.992" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.692" end="00:03:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This revision number isn&#39;t the one</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.992" end="00:03:01.792" style="s2">listed in the [music] incident summary.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.392" end="00:03:04.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Log it. Don&#39;t correct the record by</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.792" end="00:03:04.892" style="s2">replacing the evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.292" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The previous team said it worked. They</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.592" end="00:03:10.492" style="s2">wanted a photograph before the</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.692" end="00:03:11.792" style="s2">inspection [music] finished.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.492" end="00:03:15.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A photograph doesn&#39;t get to approve a</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.792" end="00:03:15.692" style="s2">machine. Keep the old system isolated.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.502" end="00:03:19.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.392" end="00:03:21.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The scenery overran during the opening</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.192" end="00:03:22.792" style="s2">night technical rehearsal. A falling</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.087" end="00:03:25.292" style="s2">[music] piece injured Soren. This</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.792" end="00:03:26.392" style="s2">drawing alone cannot tell us why.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.292" end="00:03:28.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then ask the people who stored the</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.392" end="00:03:29.092" style="s2">original parts.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.092" end="00:03:30.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The insurer&#39;s custodian holds [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.092" end="00:03:31.692" style="s2">the incident components. We request</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.492" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">access through the review team.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.692" end="00:03:34.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please include every version. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">want the family [music] choosing which</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.192" end="00:03:38.592" style="s2">mistake I get to see.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.892" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I changed the catalog entry. I need to</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.592" end="00:03:41.592" style="s2">check who instructed it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.892" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Write down what you remember now. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.592" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">wait until everybody agrees on a story.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.492" end="00:03:49.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said 7:00. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.492" end="00:03:51.492" style="s2">I&#39;m still at the archive was. I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:53.292" style="s2">home in 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.492" end="00:03:54.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I have to stop eating until you get</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.292" end="00:03:55.692" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.492" end="00:03:57.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.692" end="00:03:58.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Your dinner doesn&#39;t have to wait for</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.792" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">a grown-up&#39;s delay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.892" end="00:04:03.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right. Start without me. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.592" end="00:04:03.394" style="s2">explain when I get home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.294" end="00:04:46.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon knows the original production.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.994" end="00:04:47.394" style="s2">I&#39;ve requested a meeting, not handed him</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.694" end="00:04:48.994" style="s2">your keys. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.394" end="00:04:50.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the scope first. Clara must know</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.994" end="00:04:51.894" style="s2">who is being asked to assess her work.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.794" end="00:04:54.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him come. I won&#39;t be introduced as</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.894" end="00:04:55.494" style="s2">the woman who is notebook.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:56.718" style="s2">Let him come under his own name. This</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.494" end="00:04:59.694" style="s2">time I won&#39;t be introduced as the woman</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.718" end="00:04:59.694" style="s2">[music] who carried his notebook.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.794" end="00:05:04.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those tools [music] came from my</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.594" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">production. You can&#39;t build a new career</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.294" end="00:05:07.794" style="s2">with property you walked out with.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.194" end="00:05:09.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That box belonged to my father. Your</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.794" end="00:05:10.394" style="s2">inventory lists a different serial</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.194" end="00:05:12.794" style="s2">number. Read it before touching</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.394" end="00:05:12.794" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.694" end="00:05:19.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always did need me to finish a show.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.794" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You needed me not [music] to sign one.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.494" end="00:05:26.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask her what happened to the last stage</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.794" end="00:05:27.694" style="s2">he was responsible for. The independent</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.394" end="00:05:28.994" style="s2">review is already asking. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.694" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">Today&#39;s visit doesn&#39;t authorize you to</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.994" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">remove her belongings.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.694" end="00:05:34.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t replace everything he insulted.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.053" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.594" end="00:05:37.194" style="s2">I need space to use what I already</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.094" end="00:05:38.294" style="s2">owned.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.194" end="00:05:40.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me where the workbench should</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:40.594" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.894" end="00:05:44.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked for help, not [music] an</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.794" end="00:05:46.194" style="s2">audience. What do you need me to bring?</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.394" end="00:05:47.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fabric samples and your honest eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.194" end="00:05:48.994" style="s2">Also the old notebooks you kept when I</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.494" end="00:05:49.894" style="s2">stopped coming [music] to the studio.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.994" end="00:05:51.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where does this go?</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.894" end="00:05:54.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it. We can make a window before we</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.294" end="00:05:54.194" style="s2">can afford the whole sky.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.669" end="00:05:57.689" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.694" end="00:06:02.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can watch first. Nobody has to stand</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.794" end="00:06:05.295" style="s2">up and introduce [music] themselves</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.794" end="00:06:06.804" style="s2">today. There&#39;s a place by the door, Eli.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.295" end="00:06:09.095" style="s2">Staying for 10 minutes counts as trying</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.804" end="00:06:09.095" style="s2">[music] too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.044" end="00:06:14.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.195" end="00:06:14.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I need to sit there until I find the</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.015" end="00:06:16.595" style="s2">[music] glue?</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.895" end="00:06:19.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. I&#39;m not racing you to the</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.595" end="00:06:19.195" style="s2">next step.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.595" end="00:06:23.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The family office requested a recovery</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.995" end="00:06:23.834" style="s2">photograph. Just one with the boy</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.195" end="00:06:23.895" style="s2">smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.834" end="00:06:25.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.895" end="00:06:28.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it away. I approved a visit, not a</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.595" end="00:06:29.695" style="s2">photograph of his progress.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.695" end="00:06:30.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He isn&#39;t a before [music] and after</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.695" end="00:06:32.095" style="s2">picture.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.695" end="00:06:33.095" style="s2">Neither am I.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:34.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll correct the request with the</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.095" end="00:06:35.095" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.295" end="00:06:37.495" style="s2">You shouldn&#39;t have to guard every</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.095" end="00:06:37.495" style="s2">doorway.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.095" end="00:06:41.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stayed until the end, but I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.995" end="00:06:41.895" style="s2">everyone watching me next time.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.519" end="00:06:43.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.895" end="00:06:46.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we keep the same small group. I can</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.495" end="00:06:46.495" style="s2">wait outside with the bags.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.695" end="00:06:53.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s our first audience. One person,</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.095" end="00:06:57.695" style="s2">one clear choice.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.895" end="00:06:57.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hand is too small for the sky.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.095" end="00:07:03.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept [music] the drawings. I didn&#39;t</p>
